            "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:18:51.2718+00:00",
            "notes": "For the fourth power I prefer to go distortion. I will go serenity if i need more personal survival. Distortion or protective beam if my team needs more survival (protective beam requires the target to be 80% health so if they're low a lot I'd get distortion). As for items, the same I wrote in the last round applies here as well. Get what you think is best for what your team needs! Weapon power for more healing, weapon speed for faster healing, cooldown reduction for more rezzes/triage, or survivability if you need to live! I like to get resurrection rangefinder for the last round/enemy game point bc it's the most important round that you need to win so safer rezzes are always great!",
